   "id": "m05s2",
   "title": "The CAS Execution Template",
   "html": "<blockquote class=\"quote\"><p>b. CAS Execution Template. By its very nature, the execution of CAS differs in every tactical situation. The following considerations and recommendations are meant to be a guide for execution of CAS, so that both CAS aircrew and JTACs have a standard, repeatable format to expect in the highly dynamic CAS environment. The execution template is a technique used to organize the flow of events from when an aircraft first checks in with a JTAC, through a CAS brief and attack, to when the aircraft checks out.</p><cite>JP 3-09.3, p. V-14</cite></blockquote><div class=\"kneeboard\"><div class=\"kb-head\"><span>CAS Execution Template</span><small>Chapter V, para 2b(1)–(12)</small></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">1</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Routing/Safety of Flight</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">2</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">CAS Aircraft Check-In</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">3</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Situation Update</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">4</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Game Plan</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">5</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">CAS Brief</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">6</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Remarks/Restrictions</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">7</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Readbacks</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">8</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Correlation</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">9</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Attack</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">10</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Assess Effectiveness of the Attack</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">11</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">BDA</div></div></div><div class=\"kb-line\"><div class=\"kb-n\">12</div><div class=\"kb-b\"><div class=\"kb-t\">Routing/Safety of Flight</div></div></div></div>",
